    "detailed_description": "<strong>What will you do?</strong><br>In [Counter-Stroke: Grand Building], you will command a squad, break down from the top of the building floor by floor, use billiard cues and the skills of soldiers to defeat the enemy until the VIP is rescued.<br><br><strong>Main features</strong><br>- Strong emphasis on strategy<br>- Command the players to the designated position with a pool cue<br>- Find the enemy's weak points and defeat them<br>- Easy to learn, hard to master<br>- Randomly generated maps, each time has a different exploration experience<br><br><strong>Game Show</strong><br><i>Using billiard cues to guide players' actions</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078850/extras/3e0bea8f86e06ec62660db1b35ddff21.poster.avif?t=1733827042\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078850/extras/3e0bea8f86e06ec62660db1b35ddff21.webm?t=1733827042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078850/extras/3e0bea8f86e06ec62660db1b35ddff21.mp4?t=1733827042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Find the enemy's weakness</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078850/extras/6d5b1b4d609ffbcf450b54b4e5a4abea.poster.avif?t=1733827042\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078850/extras/6d5b1b4d609ffbcf450b54b4e5a4abea.webm?t=1733827042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078850/extras/6d5b1b4d609ffbcf450b54b4e5a4abea.mp4?t=1733827042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><i>Using shooting and skills to destroy the enemy</i><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c